{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957130/extras/401127066fa82c7835cd7c26a6a866c9.avif?t=1773302567\" alt=\"Bugscraper\" width=616 height=179 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the Bugscraper.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bugscraper</strong> is a <strong>solo</strong> or <strong>co-op roguelike shooter</strong>. As you climb toward your tyrannical boss\u2019s office, you\u2019ll battle floor after floor of enemies. Using a wide arsenal of weapons and upgrades, mow them down and aim for the top!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc1c Play as <strong>Mio and his friends</strong>, in\u00a0<strong>solo</strong> or in <strong>local co-op</strong> with up to 4 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc1b Fight through a <strong>hundred waves</strong> packed with <strong>furious enemies</strong> and <strong>tough bosses</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc1d Gather <strong>new weapons</strong>, drink up on <strong>helpful</strong>\u00a0<strong>upgrades</strong>, and get ready for battle on the next floor!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc1e <strong>Reach the top</strong> of the building and <strong>settle the score</strong> with your boss!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2957130?t=1773302567","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957130/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773302567","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957130/02385aea8da6cd2c3a63664e158ce3493ab41f08/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773302567","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957130/02385aea8da6cd2c3a63664e158ce3493ab41f08/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773302567","categories":[